{"4192320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gun Goose", "steam_appid": 4192320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Goose is a third-person shooter where you're a goose that can somehow use guns. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Honk and load</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/a7c49b856e584714d84efc47223fbed9.poster.avif?t=1786091680\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/a7c49b856e584714d84efc47223fbed9.webm?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/a7c49b856e584714d84efc47223fbed9.mp4?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a ton of guns from a little pistol to a minigun to blast your way through foes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crazy enemies and bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From literal waves of chickens wielding knives, anti-air cows, some guy with a gun, flying fish and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goose and all enemies are physics-driven, leading to funny moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying physics-based goose combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/613c33a6f4de3b5c6344f12bf20e5149.poster.avif?t=1786091680\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/613c33a6f4de3b5c6344f12bf20e5149.webm?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/613c33a6f4de3b5c6344f12bf20e5149.mp4?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience and master smooth goose movement and handcrafted gunplay. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Goose Army:</strong> Get the highest score as goosely possible in a limited time and pick up power-ups to help you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goose Survivor: </strong>THEY ARE COMING FOR YOU. How long can you survive the onslaught until your goose is cooked?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Goose Game:</strong> You get a different gun each time you get enough kills. Get through the whole arsenal as fast as you can!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/4a7c4f11edc4f793054ba9f8e7376bbb.poster.avif?t=1786091680\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/4a7c4f11edc4f793054ba9f8e7376bbb.webm?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/4a7c4f11edc4f793054ba9f8e7376bbb.mp4?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based combat and movement </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps across the Goose-verse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Various fun game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lots of weapons to shoot with </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of enemies to shoot at</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics (goose and duck species, hats, weapon skins, and more) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards and high replayability</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Goose is a third-person shooter where you're a goose that can somehow use guns. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Honk and load</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/a7c49b856e584714d84efc47223fbed9.poster.avif?t=1786091680\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/a7c49b856e584714d84efc47223fbed9.webm?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/a7c49b856e584714d84efc47223fbed9.mp4?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a ton of guns from a little pistol to a minigun to blast your way through foes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crazy enemies and bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From literal waves of chickens wielding knives, anti-air cows, some guy with a gun, flying fish and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goose and all enemies are physics-driven, leading to funny moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Satisfying physics-based goose combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/613c33a6f4de3b5c6344f12bf20e5149.poster.avif?t=1786091680\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/613c33a6f4de3b5c6344f12bf20e5149.webm?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/613c33a6f4de3b5c6344f12bf20e5149.mp4?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience and master smooth goose movement and handcrafted gunplay. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Goose Army:</strong> Get the highest score as goosely possible in a limited time and pick up power-ups to help you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goose Survivor: </strong>THEY ARE COMING FOR YOU. How long can you survive the onslaught until your goose is cooked?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Goose Game:</strong> You get a different gun each time you get enough kills. Get through the whole arsenal as fast as you can!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/4a7c4f11edc4f793054ba9f8e7376bbb.poster.avif?t=1786091680\" width=640 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/4a7c4f11edc4f793054ba9f8e7376bbb.webm?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/extras/4a7c4f11edc4f793054ba9f8e7376bbb.mp4?t=1786091680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based combat and movement </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps across the Goose-verse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Various fun game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lots of weapons to shoot with </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of enemies to shoot at</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetics (goose and duck species, hats, weapon skins, and more) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards and high replayability</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The most realistic goose simulator ever made... Gun Goose is a fast-paced shooter where you play as a goose with guns. Fight in satisfying physics-driven combat as you blast through hordes of equally insane enemies with your arsenal and skills. HONK AND LOAD!", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Korean, French, Italian, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/5439be29070eacc5c52448a306485cf49806a0b2/header.jpg?t=1786091680", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/0143036733499b0bb091d3287768e9b77443a8d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786091680", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4192320/0143036733499b0bb091d3287768e9b77443a8d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786091680", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8GB GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD 4000 or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Snapsro"], "publishers": ["Snapsro"], "demos": [{"appid": 4725030, "description": "